1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,650
Bu — Zamin FK stadioni.

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:05,400
Muxlislar soni... nol.

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,306
Bitta echkini hisoblamasak.

4
00:00:08,306 --> 00:00:11,206
Biz — Qoratepadan chiqqan havaskor klubmiz.

5
00:00:11,306 --> 00:00:13,506
Bizda qattiqqo‘l murabbiy bor...

6
00:00:13,606 --> 00:00:16,306
o‘zini yulduz deb o‘ylaydigan hujumchi bor...

7
00:00:16,306 --> 00:00:19,506
darvozabonimiz esa qo‘lqopini hali ham qidiryapti.

8
00:00:19,706 --> 00:00:22,973
Klub fondida esa atigi 15 million so‘m.

9
00:00:22,973 --> 00:00:26,173
Maqsadimiz — eng quyi havaskor ligadan

10
00:00:26,173 --> 00:00:28,973
O‘zbekiston futbolining eng yuqori pog‘onasigacha chiqish.

11
00:00:29,373 --> 00:00:31,773
Ha... hozircha yo‘l uzoq.

12
00:00:31,773 --> 00:00:33,773
Lekin bu yerda SIZ keraksiz!

13
00:00:33,773 --> 00:00:36,773
Har bir obunachi — tribunada bitta virtual muxlis.

14
00:00:36,773 --> 00:00:39,073
Har bir layk — klub fondiga bir dollar.

15
00:00:39,073 --> 00:00:41,573
Keling, bu stadionni birga to‘ldiramiz!

16
00:00:41,573 --> 00:00:43,773
Birinchi qarorni siz qabul qilasiz:

17
00:00:43,773 --> 00:00:48,573
stadion, yangi hujumchi, mashg‘ulot bazasi yoki yangi murabbiy?

18
00:00:48,573 --> 00:00:50,173
Izohga bitta so‘z yozing.

19
00:00:50,173 --> 00:00:52,673
Eng ko‘p layk olgan izoh — 24 soatdan keyin g‘olib!

